Adam "'''friberg'''" Friberg {{born}} is a [[:Category:Sweden|Swedish]] professional ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' coach, a former ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' commentator, and a former ''[[Counter-Strike: Global Offensive]]'' and ''[[Counter-Strike: Source]]'' player. Following a legendary 5-year tenure with [[Ninjas in Pyjamas]], he signed for [[OpTic Gaming]] as the [[:Category:In-game leaders|in-game leader]]. 6 months later, the team disbanded, and friberg was left teamless for 3 months until he joined [[Heroic]]. After leaving [[Heroic]] in late August 2019, he reunited with his old [[Ninjas in Pyjamas|NiP]] teammates Patrik "[[f0rest]]" Lindberg, Christopher "[[GeT_RiGhT]]" Alesund, Richard "[[Xizt]]" Landström, and Robin "[[Fifflaren]]" Johansson in a new [[Dignitas]] lineup in January 2020. <ref name="friberg joins Dignitas">{{cite web|url=http://dignitas.gg/articles/news/CSGO/14152/a-new-dynasty-welcome-dig-csgo|title=A New Dynasty {{!}} Welcome DIG CS:GO|date=2020-01-21|publisher=[[Dignitas]]|author=[[sapphiRe]]}}</ref>

